{"seq":1,"ts":"2026-11-13T12:40:32.675Z","type":"exp.start","exp":"E-HOSTED-CROSS-LIVE-02","attempt":1,"title":"A block trade with a minimum fill on the real hardware room: an order whose pro-rata fill would be under its minimum is cancelled, the cross is recomputed, and the production contract settles exactly","tier":"hardware","hypothesis":"Predictions are in docs/lab/PROGRAMME_PLAN.md, committed before this file existed. A buyer who set a minimum of 3 units and would have been filled 2 is cancelled; the cross is computed again without them, so the other buyer fills all 5 units; the published outcome says one order was cancelled and not whose; the contract charges and pays exactly.","limits":["One operator controls every account and the VM.","Only the middle of a block trade is modelled: no indications of interest or firm-up step, no minimum fill, no time priority, a supplied reference price, and only the cash leg settles.","Charges and payouts are public on NEAR, so filled units can be worked out from the cash and the public reference price."],"requires":["phala-key","near-key","network","docker"],"chain_prev":"e7c038992d0e0ee2cf583d39eaf8dfcfb3481228a290a112b0badc9eaf71eab5","chain_hash":"afe92ccdfb7e510738bf850b46b9c077c898f8fa4f1d993906d5c4346f5094ee"}
